    "updated_at": "2023-01-06T15:27:25Z",
    "body": "Right, and that invariant is important as in theory the whole browsing context group can run in a single process on lower end devices.\r\n\r\nDo you have a write-up somewhere for restrict-properties that clearly documents all the requirements? Perhaps we should consider alternative designs.",
