    "created_at": "2023-02-14T14:44:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-14T14:44:37Z",
    "body": "The other thing I want to raise again while we're talking about this is that popups still present a significant privacy challenge we all have to overcome. Adding significant complexity around popups at this time seems like a risky investment.\r\n\r\nIn particular because the use cases we typically discuss are centered around logins, for which FedCM aims to be the solution. Which raises these questions:\r\n\r\n1. Do we have a lot of non-login use cases that warrant this?\r\n2. How do we imagine addressing the privacy issues for the non-login use cases?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
